<title>FINLAND: SAVON SANOMAT 4-MONTH PROFIT RISES 47 PCT.</title>
<headline>SAVON SANOMAT 4-MONTH PROFIT RISES 47 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, </p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	    8.5 vs 5.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.70 vs 1.83</p>
<p> Net sales					   62.3 vs 61.2</p>
<p> Operating profit				   8.1 vs 7.3</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	11.7 vs 11.1</p>
<p> Depreciation					 3.6 vs 3.8</p>
<p> Financial items			     gain 0.4 vs 1.5 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						  1.0 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Net profit					   7.5 vs 5.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Savon Sanomat Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
